@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5346

### Begin provider login (open in a browser — this returns a 302 to Keycloak)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/provider/login

###

### Begin patient login (open in a browser — this returns a 302 to Keycloak)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/patient/login

###

### Begin owner login (open in a browser — this returns a 302 to Keycloak)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/owner/login

###

### Keycloak application-initiated action (password, 2FA, email) — needs that realm's
### session cookie, so open in a signed-in browser. 302 to Keycloak with kc_action;
### 400 for an action outside UPDATE_PASSWORD, CONFIGURE_TOTP, UPDATE_EMAIL.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/provider/action/UPDATE_PASSWORD?returnUrl=/provider/account/security

###

GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/patient/action/CONFIGURE_TOTP?returnUrl=/patient/account/security

###

### Current session (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider, __Host-anamnys-patient
### or __Host-anamnys-owner cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

###

### End the provider session
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/provider/logout

###

### End the patient session
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/patient/logout

###

### End the owner session
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/auth/owner/logout

###

### Own profile (needs the matching realm's session cookie — send from a signed-in browser)
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/profile

###

PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "crpNumber": "06/12345", "crpRegion": "SP" }

###

GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/patients/me/profile

###

PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/patients/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ana", "lastName": "Souza", "phone": "+55 11 91234-5678", "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-02" }

###
### Note detail (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Status, raw transcript and failure reason of one note. Replace the id with a real note id.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
### Restructure note (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Re-runs the AI structuring of a ReadyForReview note; format is DAP, SOAP or Biopsychosocial. 202 accepted, 409 if signed/pending/edited.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/restructure
Content-Type: application/json

{ "format": "SOAP" }

###
### Edit note section (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Saves the section text. 200 { revision }; 409 reason "locked" (pending/signed) or "stale" (revision mismatch); 400 if content is null or over 20000 characters.
PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections/data
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Texto da seção.", "expectedRevision": 0 }

###
### Create blank sections (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Creates the empty sections of the note's format when it has none. 201 created, 409 if locked or it already has sections.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections/blank

###
### Sign note (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Signs a ReadyForReview note with the provider's CRP. 200 signed; 409 reason "locked" or "no_sections"; 422 reason "missing_crp".
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sign

###
### Create a typed note (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Mode "ai" organises the text into sections (201 { noteId }, structuring runs in the background); "manual" creates empty sections. 400 on invalid body; 404 unknown patient/appointment; 409 code "archived" or "appointment_unavailable".
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "appointmentId": null,
  "format": "DAP",
  "mode": "ai",
  "text": "Paciente relata dificuldade para dormir há duas semanas."
}

###
### Appointments of a patient that can receive a typed note (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie — send from a browser session, not this file)
### Last 14 days, not cancelled, without a note. 200 array newest first; 404 for an unknown patient.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/note-candidates

###
### Search the provider's notes (requires the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie - send from a browser session, not this file)
### Filters live in the body: patient names never go in a URL. status: pending | signed | failed (omit for all); 25 per page, newest first; 200 { items, hasMore }.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending",
  "patientId": null,
  "name": null,
  "page": 1
}

###

### Export a signed note as PDF (returns a presigned URL valid for 1 hour)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/export

###

### Psychometric scales (all require the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie - send from a browser session, not this file)
### Instruments with the provider-specific regime: available | needs_opt_in | opted_in | unavailable. 200 array of 15.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/instruments

###
### Opt in to a "sem classificacao" instrument. 204; 404 unknown; 409 opt_in_not_allowed.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/instruments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/opt-in

###
### Scale series of a patient, grouped by instrument; optional sessionId filter. 200 array; 404 unknown patient.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/scales?sessionId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
### Record a score (score and date only). 201 { id }; 400 validation; 404; 409 archived | instrument_unavailable | opt_in_required.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/scales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "score": 12,
  "appliedAt": "2026-10-18T12:00:00Z",
  "sessionId": null
}

###
### Remove a recorded score (soft removal). 204; 404.
DELETE {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/scales/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
### Psychological documents (all require the __Host-anamnys-provider cookie - send from a browser session, not this file)
### Available kinds with their ruleset elements and prohibitions. 200 array of 3.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/document-kinds

###
### Document check mode. 200 { documentCheckMode }.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/document-settings

###
### Change the check mode (blocking | advisory). 200; 400 on other values.
PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/document-settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentCheckMode": "advisory"
}

###
### Documents of a patient, newest first. 200 array; 404 unknown patient.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/documents

###
### Create a draft. 201 { id }; 404; 409 archived | kind_not_available.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "declaracao",
  "noteId": null
}

###
### Document detail with the conformity check. 200; 404.
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###
### Save a draft. 200 detail; 400 field too long; 404; 409 locked.
PUT {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fields": { "finalidade": "" },
  "confirmations": []
}

###
### Sign. 200; 404; 409 locked | missing_elements | confirmations_required (+ missing[]); 422 missing_crp | missing_city.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acknowledgeMissing": false
}

###
### Correct a signed document (new draft copy). 201 { id }; 404; 409 locked | archived.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/correct

###
### Export a signed document as PDF (presigned URL valid for 1 hour). 200 { url, expiresAt }; 404; 409 not_signed; 503 storage_unavailable.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/export###
### Search the provider's documents. Filters live in the body: patient names never go in a URL. status: draft | signed | superseded (omit for all); 25 per page, newest first; 200 { items, hasMore }.
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/phi/providers/me/documents/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "signed",
  "patientId": null,
  "name": null,
  "page": 1
}


